e.\n- v1 scope covers **all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only** (Gemini deferred).\n- Auth: run the **Anchor service as `john`** to resolve the LocalSystem credential wall.\n- Remote access: **bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*` endpoints.\n\n**Provenance**\n- Member documents: Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, Decision Log.\n- Decisions and their adversarial findings were driven through the Crucible planning loop (2026-06-07/08)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":59282,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35ca03cc-7281-480a-8ea3-294084abb062","uuid":"a461d263-2e2a-4bc9-bdaf-425289245084","request_id":"req_011Cc5QUhoLE9jFDPt2mk79x"}
